{'symbol': 'PPL', 'date': '2021-09-23 17:22:00', 'title': 'PPL CORPORATION RECEIVES FERC APPROVAL TO ACQUIRE THE NARRAGANSETT ELECTRIC COMPANY', 'text': 'ALLENTOWN, PA., SEPT. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PPL CORPORATION (NYSE: PPL) TODAY RECEIVED UNANIMOUS APPROVAL FROM THE FEDERAL ENERGY REGULATORY COMMISSION TO ACQUIRE THE NARRAGANSETT ELECTRIC COMPANY FROM NATIONAL GRID USA.'}